<title>USA: US Airways March load factor up.</title>
<headline>US Airways March load factor up.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Va. 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>US Airways Group Inc said on Thursday that its March load factor increased to 75.2 percent, a record high for the carrier, from 70.8 percent in March 1996.</p>
<p>Total revenue passenger miles for March increased 11.4 percent to 3.80 billion from 3.41 billion and available seat miles increased to 5.05 billion from 4.81 billion, US Airways said.</p>
</text>
